<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces have again foiled a Hezbollah-linked plot to attack the Homs oil refinery, accusing the group of planning a bomb attack. Israeli airstrikes have struck southern Syria, causing civilian casualties. Saudi and Syrian leaders met and warned that renewed military escalation could threaten global security and the economy, while Damascus is considering joining the Mecca Pact. The conflict continues to generate high fatalities, with 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQZk8zcFI3ZUtEOTczT0lJYTFORHp5OTVObnJfdHN1ODk5Ymo4YlJ1eV9wSFg4UkxSWGY0ejl6ZmREb2cxMEMzVHQwSHc5TE1SaWZBUUVwX2ZiYXRNSGxKQjdFZzRHYnRwTXFuTjdLa05xbDN4WWJCYlNEcFBkV1VBY0JBQ1RxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Syria Direct&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPR0k4VHp0Ml9YQjAyUnFuTXppdHdFOHJfanlNTlk0V01XdWtkWVRsdmFNTXNvWWRuaEtwR0lJaDJYaFFsU19UWGQzeDZpaEZOV1VjOFNlWnNzNFlKUHEtc2FJMW43dDNHVlpFNU1KaE43TEtyenJJZEVXd1JBemxrTU1UNEZNQ3dhYkFTNWVibk9EdmJ6WDZMeU8tUDAzMklpRWtF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9mQkFGS0NRN2J6U0tHQUs2UVc3QW1DQ3pNaGtwZW16M21XTzRBNElFYnFxVGVXR25MVFoxbHFWQy0wWlktSTVPOVhzNnFDRG9RWDV4QzlFNjM5V1M1?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/r